# Facility party invitations

Birthday invitation themes are customer-entered text and should be interpreted using fuzzy matching against the curated local invitation library in `public/invitation-library/`. Compose invitations from those local assets. Do not generate a full invitation picture from scratch and do not call paid image APIs.

- Keep aliases and theme IDs in `src/lib/facility-parties/invitations/theme-catalog.ts` and library manifests so they persist in the repo.
- Do not require a strict dropdown for party theme.
- Do not reproduce Disney, Marvel, Bluey, Paw Patrol, Pokémon, Mario, Sonic, or other protected characters, costumes, logos, names, or distinctive artwork. Map branded requests to generic library themes only.
- The matched theme must drive the booking-form preview, saved invitation snapshot, admin print view, guest share view, and 4-per-page sheet.
- Customers may type a new theme to rematch (this resets the alternate counter) or load up to 3 other layouts/heroes/palettes from the **same** matched theme. Persist the chosen option index/variant; do not re-randomize later.
